You are invited to subscribe to an e-mail list for purposes of discussion 
of imputation of missing data.
I have been creating and using multiple imputations for several months, 
after some study of the topic, and hope to gain from the knowledge, 
wisdom, and experience of other users, especially in regard to a number of 
decisions one has to make in applications.  Maybe others have similar 
interests; hence, this new list.
