On a Pentium II 400 MHz (dual processor)
524 MB RAM
Running on Linux kernel 2.0.36

and for this simple function (incomplete bootstrap):

function (x, nboot, theta, ...)
{
    data <- matrix(sample(x, size = length(x) * nboot, replace = T),
        nrow = nboot)
    return(apply(data, 1, theta))
