Thanks to Bill Venables, Dave Krantz, Frank Harrell, Alan Zaslavsky and
others for two different solutions to my question concerning alphabetizing
the columnnames in a dataframe.

Solution 1:  dat2 <- dat1[sort(names(dat1))]

Solution 2:  dat2 <- dat1[, order(names(dat1))] 

Thanks particularly to Dave Krantz for answering my question with an
explanation for why solution 1 works (and, by extension, why solution 2
works). 

