Terry,

A related approach is the store function in the Hmisc library:

store()
#Creates a temp directory, puts this in search position 1
#Now any object created is temporary
store(modelfit)  # Store permanently in _Data
stores(a,b,c)     # store multiple objects

When you exit the session, an automatically constructed .Last
function removes the temp directory.

-Frank Harrell

