From bates at stat.wisc.edu  Tue Apr 20 17:08:57 1999
From: bates at stat.wisc.edu (Douglas Bates)
Date: Tue, 20 Apr 1999 12:08:57 -0500
Subject: Re: [S] Testreport: Math. & stat. software for data analysis
