Rector Vermeylen (second floor) of Het Pand, a former 
Dominican monastery (13th century), now owned by the 
Universiteit Gent.  Het Pand is located in the historic centre 
of Ghent, at the following address:  Onderbergen 1, 9000 
Ghent.  For more information, consult the symposium web site 
under the heading VENUE AND TOURIST INFORMATION.
     
